				{
					"id": 710550605,
					"content": "對啊對啊，我的爸爸是…是層岩巨淵裡的礦工，可了不起了，我的媽媽在生下我之後不久就病死了，是他一個人把我拉拔大的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚楠"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550606,
					"content": "層岩巨淵的礦下面那麼黑，那麼暗…「可是爸爸一想到我，就什麼也不害怕了，一直在這裡咬著牙拼命工作。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚楠"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550607,
					"content": "那，妳怎麼到層岩巨淵下面來了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550608,
					"content": "我…我想我的爸爸了，他工作忙，每次下礦都要一個月才能回一次家。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚楠"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550609,
					"content": "他不在家的時候，家裡就只有我一個人…「要是發生了什麼事，我該多麼寂寞和害怕呀。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚楠"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550610,
					"content": "#但{F#妳}{M#你}看，如果我能到礦下就好了。「在營地裡，爸爸就能每天都見到我了，就能天天照顧我，保護我。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550611,
						710550612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚楠"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550611,
					"content": "可是這裡很危險。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550613
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710550613,
					"content": "#嗯…{NICKNAME}說得對，這裡可危險了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550614,
					"content": "我們把妳帶回營地吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550615,
					"content": "那可不行，我偷偷來這裡，要是讓他知道，他一定會生氣的，那樣我就再也沒法出來玩了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚楠"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550616,
					"content": "#對了，{F#妳}{M#你}們不是要找那個娃娃嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚楠"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550617,
					"content": "我知道那個娃娃在哪裡…嘻嘻，跟我來吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "戚楠"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550612,
					"content": "還是先回去吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550613
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7105507,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7105511
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7105511",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7105511,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"戚楠"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 710550701,
					"content": "爸爸不在家的時候，如果有人欺負我，我都不知道該怎麼辦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚楠"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550702,
					"content": "每次爸爸回家的時間長一點就好了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚楠"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550703,
					"content": "如果爸爸能夠一直在身邊的話，我也不用那樣「乖巧懂事」，就會是個常常和爸爸撒嬌的，天真的小孩了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550704
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚楠"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550704,
					"content": "嗯…玩具？那個玩具娃娃就在前面喔？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550705
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚楠"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550705,
					"content": "丟了那個玩具爸爸一定很著急很著急，一定要…找到那個玩具才行啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "戚楠"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7105508,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7105513
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7105513",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7105513,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"派蒙",
					"戚定"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 710550801,
					"content": "戚定！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550802,
					"content": "#啊…咦，這不是大名鼎鼎的{NICKNAME}和…身邊的小飛人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚定"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550803,
					"content": "身邊的小飛人是什麼奇怪的稱呼啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550804,
					"content": "我也是有名字的，我叫派蒙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550805,
					"content": "#抱歉抱歉，派蒙、{NICKNAME}，找我…是有什麼事嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚定"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550806,
					"content": "咦，你怎麼忘了呢，我們當時受你所託去找東西，但是那地方只有一箱潮濕的火藥…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550807,
					"content": "唉…實在不好意思，我之前在層岩巨淵底下，被什麼東西影響了，腦袋一直昏昏沉沉，到了上面才…才稍微清醒了一點。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚定"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550808,
					"content": "聽瑾武說我在下面大哭大鬧，還、還真是丟臉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚定"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550809,
					"content": "#不過{F#妳}{M#你}們說起火藥我就想起來了，我確實是打算拿那些火藥…去炸掉那個「許願石」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550810,
						710550811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚定"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550810,
					"content": "「許願石」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550812
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710550812,
					"content": "當年封礦的時候，就有幾個兄弟下礦，說礦裡挖出了許願石，說只要在許願石周圍，不管什麼願望都能實現。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550813
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚定"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550813,
					"content": "還有這樣的東西…我只是隨口問問，那個許願石現在還在嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550814,
					"content": "應該還在吧，就是一塊非常大的石頭，懸在幾塊巨岩之間，還散發著幽光…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550815
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚定"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550815,
					"content": "唔…這描述聽上去怎麼這麼像…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550816
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550816,
					"content": "之前和志瓊看到的大晶石。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550817
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710550817,
					"content": "#啊？{F#妳}{M#你}們也看到「許願石」啦，得小心，那不能隨便靠近啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚定"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550818,
					"content": "那些兄弟，都是被那個許願石弄得精神失常，七星也不得不封礦，結果…結果工作就耽擱了好幾年。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550819
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚定"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550819,
					"content": "這次下礦，我也遇到了那個石頭，要是那石頭作祟，這邊再被封，不就又沒活了…沒活幹就只能去港口打短工，賺不到什麼摩拉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚定"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550820,
					"content": "所以我決定把那個石頭炸了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550821
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚定"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550821,
					"content": "但是…下去之後，愈靠近那個石頭，就愈是頭痛，腦袋也愈是亂…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550822
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚定"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550822,
					"content": "#我還依稀見到…不，應該只是產生了幻覺。總之我也聽說，要不是{F#妳}{M#你}們，我可就危險了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550823
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚定"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550823,
					"content": "#真是太謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}們了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550824
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚定"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550824,
					"content": "不用謝不用謝，這都是應該做的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550825
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550825,
					"content": "喔，對了，我們還找到了這個娃娃…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550826
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550826,
					"content": "看起來破破爛爛的，也不知道和你丟的是不是同一個。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550827
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550827,
					"content": "#這、這個娃娃？！這個娃娃怎麼會在{F#妳}{M#你}們手裡，{F#妳}{M#你}們是在哪裡找到的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550828
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚定"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550828,
					"content": "這個就是你託我們找的娃娃啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550829
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550829,
					"content": "#我託{F#妳}{M#你}們找這個娃娃？這也太奇怪了，這個娃娃是我以前從飛雲商會買的，那個時候買這樣一個娃娃還得花上不少錢呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550830
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚定"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550830,
					"content": "送女兒的禮物嘛，不過後來我女兒也不玩這個娃娃了，我又捨不得扔，就帶在身邊，當作個護身符。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550831
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚定"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550831,
					"content": "幾年前封礦，緊急撤離的時候就不知道落在哪了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550832
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚定"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550832,
					"content": "#怎麼…又被{F#妳}{M#你}們找出來了呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550833,
						710550834
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚定"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550833,
					"content": "有點奇怪…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550835
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710550835,
					"content": "唉，本來還想著，靠身體硬朗，再賺兩年錢，現在看來，層岩巨淵這地方比我想的還要危險。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550836
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚定"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550836,
					"content": "以後還是不來了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550837
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚定"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550837,
					"content": "#對了，{F#妳}{M#你}們幫我和沐寧說下吧，這次我是再也不敢下礦了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550838
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚定"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550838,
					"content": "沒有問題，你就帶著戚楠好好回家吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550839
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550839,
					"content": "戚楠住在璃月，每天為總務司的事忙得不可開交，不可能到層岩巨淵這裡來的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550840
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚定"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550840,
					"content": "#不過{F#妳}{M#你}說得對，戚楠都已經長大了，我也老了，還是回家多陪陪她比較好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550841
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚定"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550841,
					"content": "不對，我是說那邊的小女孩…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550842
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550842,
					"content": "什麼小女孩？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550843
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚定"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550843,
					"content": "#那邊有什麼人在嗎…哎呀，{F#妳}{M#你}可別嚇唬我啦，這玩笑可不好笑啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550844
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戚定"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550844,
					"content": "好了好了，我這就回家，我不下礦的事，記得幫我和沐寧說一聲啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "戚定"
				},
				{
					"id": 710550834,
					"content": "有點邪門…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710550835
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710550811,
