					"派蒙"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 710551101,
					"content": "這個娃娃，怎麼看起來破破爛爛的…不過還是先還給戚定吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710551102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710551102,
					"content": "對了，還要帶上戚楠，他看見自己的女兒肯定也會高興的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710551103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710551103,
					"content": "戚楠，咦，戚楠怎麼不見了…突然消失了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710551104,
						710551106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710551104,
					"content": "…先回營地吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710551105
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710551105,
					"content": "唔…確實感覺挺奇怪的，不如我們把娃娃帶給戚定，然後問問他吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710551109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710551109,
					"content": "希望戚楠別遭遇什麼危險。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710551106,
					"content": "…有點奇怪。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710551107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710551107,
					"content": "是啊，戚楠到底什麼時候不見的？我一點聲音都沒聽到…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710551108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710551108,
					"content": "真是奇怪，不如我們把娃娃帶給戚定，然後再跟他說說他女兒的事吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710551109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
